From 335a4a1aeec0c2e843c4137403bd84d65d31b386 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:35:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] novo-app: object panels, tag search, properties and go to all
 references

- The left dock has named panels: Pages, Devices, Terminals, Cables and
  Potentials, each with a filter box and each reachable from the palette
  and the View menu.
- Ctrl+K searches commands and the project's pages, devices, terminals,
  cables and potentials in one box; a tag typed in full (k1 or -K1)
  ranks first, and picking an object selects it and shows its page.
- The properties panel shows the selected object's common fields first
  (tag, description, pages, part), then its own properties, narrowed by
  a filter box.
- Shift+G (Go menu) lists every drawing of the selected object in the
  palette; picking one jumps there with it selected.
- Selecting on the canvas selects the device or terminal behind the
  symbol.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AYuFPxz6eQReQdtzYKLMmW
